I built `controller.js` from the baseline stabilizer plus part of the recipe, and it passed 3 of the 4 smoke flights.

- **What I added:**
  - a low-pass filter on velocity;
  - small horizontal position integrals;
  - an abort-and-realign if the drone drifts off a gate opening before reaching its plane;
  - a gradual ramped descent onto the pad, with thrust cut slightly just above the floor.
